text:
You can use:
1) The picture in front of you to get inspired;

2) Your own knowledge/ experience (but don't copy them!);

3) Your imagination!

4) Also, remember that there are no wrong answers if you explain yourself clearly - so feel free to take any approach you want!

The world is full of smiles,—of those that are forced,—
Of some that’re not meant to be seen at all;
And there are some you try in vain to force,—
Though these seem never to get started at all!

Some smile because they cannot laugh outright;
Or think it better just to wear a grin;
Because their thoughts go on a bit too fast,
So that their feelings can’t keep up with them!
